<title>USA: PHLX to list four new equity options next week.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list four new equity options next week.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Thursday it would list options on four stocks next week.</p>
<p>The exchange said options on Cullen/Frost Bankers Inc, EXEL Ltd and Precision Drilling Corp will open on June 9.</p>
<p>On June 11, trading in options on Molex Inc shares will start, it said.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols and the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits in number of contracts and specialist.</p>
<p>Ticker     Strikes	Expir	 Limits   Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>CFBI.O     35, 40, 45   Jun, Jul,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>				Sep, Dec		 Group</p>
<p>XL.N	 40, 45, 50   Jul, Aug,   7,500    Spear, Leeds &amp;</p>
<p>				Oct, Jan		 Kellogg</p>
<p>PDS.N	40, 45, 50   Jun, Jul,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>				Sep, Dec		 Group</p>
<p>MOLX.O     30, 35, 40   Jul, Aug,   7,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>				Oct, Jan		 Group</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
